    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a really strong way to put it. so, if we're leaning into this for the book, how would you describe the difference between a leader who's just a product of their time and someone like robespierre, who actually shapes history? i want to really drive home the idea that without him, the revolution would have just fizzled out into nothing.",
